Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好的  有没有想过用大波霸呢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay. Have you considered using a girl with huge knockers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那不会是他们想要的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's not what they're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那对我很有用哦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, that would work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你想我为什么要买婷美呢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why do you think I buy Mrs. Butterworth's?
