Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.14,0:11:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当我流落街头的时候{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...when I was living on the street
