Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:12:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}否则我会让他死得很难看{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I was about to do some serious damage.
