Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}-是吗  -是的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- You were?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}弱小的心灵受到了严重的打击{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And it was pretty traumatic.
